# Next.js RSC

- Server Components by default; `'use client'` on the smallest interactive leaf.
- Never top-level `await` in layouts — it blocks `{children}` streaming.
- `searchParams` and `params` are Promises; await inside Suspense boundaries.
- Read bundled docs in `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before changing config.

Reference: `docs/13-nextjs-16-reference.md`
